[
  {
    "file": "screen002.png",
    "sha256": "1807dd508784cc10350454051edf2668e2a23e9418b4a358bf4731c9203d2775",
    "k": 1,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Now listen to the second interview.",
    "zh": "现在请听第二段访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "listen"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen003.png",
    "sha256": "b07596cad2e4eb8d93c22b99aedc311c7460f43214c775e822689e2e73ff0916",
    "k": 2,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions 6 to 10 are based on the second interview.",
    "zh": "第6至10题根据第二段访谈提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen004.png",
    "sha256": "cd657489b9f25a2219fd04bdf8e26a1624125aa7217b593ea6ed5fe12dbc12be",
    "k": 3,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Welcome to this edition of Our World.",
    "zh": "欢迎收听本期《我们的世界》。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "edition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen005.png",
    "sha256": "f4ff3061623f9426c3a40a92319e5922038a242ecc5172e0d64e98e6720a98c1",
    "k": 4,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Our main focus tonight will be on pollution.",
    "zh": "今晚我们主要关注污染问题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "focus",
      "pollution"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen006.png",
    "sha256": "482a7b36496f8e781465959d37263710daa83974c9450c0e1ace7dd3be28b723",
    "k": 5,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We are going to talk about a type of pollution which many people have not even heard of.",
    "zh": "我们将谈一种许多人甚至从未听说过的污染。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hear of"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen007.png",
    "sha256": "042ca359eb68ca6fee8c280bb6d936d7176ccd6345046d5665064b8dd571f2f7",
    "k": 6,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Susan Conroy is the Press Liaison officer for the Darker Skies Association.",
    "zh": "苏珊·康罗伊是暗夜天空协会的媒体联络官。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Press Liaison officer"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "5f8c5f386e6852112a2afc77c92fa594516e254e5b97405b7042abdb28dfbc22",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Susan, could you just give us a few ideas of what, in your mind, constitutes light pollution?",
    "zh": "苏珊，您能简单谈谈，在您看来，什么构成光污染吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "constitute",
      "light pollution"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "95ba7a7981ddeee6b86c8cb069355a050167cecacecabc0e57d611c96eeb8d03",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I understand one of the most serious problems is that of light escaping up into the skies above our cities, ",
    "zh": "据我了解，最严重的问题之一是光线逸散到城市上方的天空，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "escape"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "32632be2e391dc54d56480108dbcc5401f4fec09ef5dd28b804a14ce1477d27f",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "and the result is we cannot see all the stars that were once visible.",
    "zh": "结果使我们无法再看见曾经可见的所有星星。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "visible"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "98c7862ab0e3ec30971c9e634fb90492e2cf4a2979caee28a13fbbac7f39c04e",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That is what I would term a symptom of the problem and not necessarily the most serious consequence.",
    "zh": "我会把这称作问题的一个症状，而不一定是最严重的后果。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "term",
      "symptom",
      "consequence"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "9bcc7b1829eb2d9b778a0b09fc25d3a2e64d473906f596d58d27331359961723",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I would recommend your listeners, if they live in a city area, to go outside, after listening to this program of course, and to look up into the sky.",
    "zh": "我建议住在城市里的听众走到户外，当然，是听完这期节目之后，然后抬头看看天空。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "recommend",
      "look up into"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "c4d6e5b29ee620210df3fabcfa6f980a48112c4cf8fede4403229f0997ae3ebd",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I would be surprised if any of them managed to see more than five to ten stars.",
    "zh": "如果他们当中有人能看到五到十颗以上的星星，我会很惊讶。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "manage to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "0b4c0c3611fcfb441f265104866480b2e9ebc922e1d1ee91bffbc33afd3cee5f",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "If they had done this twenty years ago, they would be talking about hundreds and hundreds.",
    "zh": "如果在二十年前这样做，他们说的就会是成百上千颗星星了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hundreds and hundreds"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "2468dd1f8bab66db44bd648224af643a5ffef37fe4b6fe7eef54c064ace8d76b",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This is a problem that is getting worse, the whole light pollution situation is deteriorating.",
    "zh": "这个问题正变得越来越严重，整个光污染状况都在恶化。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "deteriorate"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "509e7a219d27a680af7bd9d491999fadf33ec32a176271a77e427973c76816e8",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Then what causes this light pollution, Susan?",
    "zh": "那么，苏珊，是什么导致了光污染呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "cause"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "a3d9164352b54e4e87105efc5525323ab0707f0ba478a377705e522db0680858",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Is it just badly positioned streetlights that shine up into the sky?",
    "zh": "只是因为路灯位置不当，光线照向天空吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "position",
      "streetlight"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "f975a623ca1bfc6b7520cc039fccc52b9440829dcc5ceb2d290fb8fa05426c26",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, that is true.",
    "zh": "嗯，确实如此。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "true"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "6ab1d3093a7a4d38a7db936d9204fcaeb37368c6f00451c3c74c1af9ad3ff727",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Poorly positioned streetlights are a major contributory factor in all of this.",
    "zh": "位置不当的路灯，确实是造成这种情况的重要因素。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "contributory factor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "562bf372b0c8905f2776f970ec1be406f742478ffb6493c128dd46c617d01845",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Light pollution is not only light that is shining up into the sky which blocks out the stars we were just talking about.",
    "zh": "光污染不只是照向天空、遮住我们刚才提到的星星的光线。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "block out"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "65207544e8dd5f957cd2b9f73860abae0af59e60a98bb3271d8cad229b1bad23",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Light pollution is also when areas are over-lit, for example, or lighting is badly designed or badly positioned, which then creates excessive glare.",
    "zh": "比如，区域照明过度，或灯光设计、安装位置不当，造成过强的眩光，也属于光污染。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "over-lit",
      "excessive",
      "glare"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "b1ee973aef5ebd436544b772442123cdd8aeb02758035be3686c1b725e74fe65",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This can obviously be dangerous if drivers are affected.",
    "zh": "如果驾驶员受到影响，这显然会带来危险。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "affect"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "50e1f9496262e51ae2e863c76b4fe45833cce75a57b8014fe0b06b33c4c15bb7",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I know so many people are worried about security and I imagine this is why huge areas of our cities are, in your words, over-lit.",
    "zh": "我知道很多人担心安全问题；我想，这正是城市中大片区域出现您所说的照明过度现象的原因。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "security",
      "over-lit"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "0680698fb9c8327dd28ec386990179faff147b5abe00dff11cc5ae388bb51ca8",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, many studies have shown there is little connection between lighting and crime.",
    "zh": "很多研究表明，照明与犯罪之间并没有多大联系。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "connection",
      "crime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "4e67801613668ecb47967f7d5c9bb5e26dcbfad385559e25e9c806fe188fcc1b",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Besides, much of the lighting which is badly designed creates very strong light and shadow contrasts, ",
    "zh": "而且，许多设计不当的照明会造成强烈的明暗对比，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "contrast"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "5059d752cc33225bd7f8d43a8f4984cb400d0ca2f0bc802b7a0a88ad82f252d4",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "which actually creates good hiding places for criminals.",
    "zh": "反而为犯罪分子提供很好的藏身之处。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hiding places",
      "criminal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "ea787722317b0a36f9bfd7f2c10d0a14da3b7fcb5c80c329d730ec18f97d1429",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So what changes would you like to see implemented, Susan?",
    "zh": "那么，苏珊，您希望看到哪些改变得到落实？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "implement"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "960785f43a3bc63f67a67ee303028140224c95c60c0739158090c3d26ba87450",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I think there are some very basic things that can be changed.",
    "zh": "我认为，有些非常基本的地方可以改变。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "basic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "1bcb3714be3e87005d6d1fce667b79eb23de1b9b4a4f2e654cf0cf5af3c8afc3",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "There needs to be a standard for street lighting which eliminates completely above-horizontal light escape.",
    "zh": "街道照明需要有一套标准，完全消除向水平方向以上逸散的光线。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "standard",
      "eliminate",
      "above-horizontal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "a16a374005a6afff754df0b3db3083ddd27692294c987399140f0bd836a75717",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "By that I mean we can’t continue to use inefficient street lighting equipment which enables a lot of light emitted to escape upwards into the sky.",
    "zh": "我的意思是，我们不能继续使用效率低下的路灯设备，让发出的大量光线向上逸散到天空中。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "inefficient",
      "emit"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "6dd6fc91151e8d6be5fe05eb1f3ac6ba3be49e80a6178de28f3cfe3a166abfab",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That is the first priority.",
    "zh": "这是首要任务。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "first priority"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "21f40239277407c9dc36726738840e9ef0c83091513200a8249d523dc50ef242",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Next, we need tough restrictions on how much light is used to illuminate a given area.",
    "zh": "其次，需要严格限制用于照亮某个区域的光量。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "restriction",
      "illuminate",
      "given"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "34284b5b3a3d8d2f43823bafc2db5be62769ae8041c6af3b90cd98862aa6240d",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That way, we avoid the problem of what is called light trespass, ",
    "zh": "这样就能避免所谓的“光侵扰”：",
    "vocabulary": [
      "light trespass"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "3b2871994eca038d3709e43c919d389cc29fa568f689bbd8619b2582bfff67fe",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "where light escapes from the area, for example, a parking lot, that it is supposed to illuminate ",
    "zh": "光线从本应照亮的区域，比如停车场，逸散出去，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "parking lot",
      "be supposed to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "13196987568f721cfdc5bf7198e9fbb52f5b3be76d03d0306c9104e3c916db15",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 3,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "and goes, for instance, into nearby windows or roads.",
    "zh": "并照向附近的窗户或道路等地方。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "nearby"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "94da10bbf0d9ac9d88030166aae7fa9a9598a6af0c4ad1ac69c4bd266d084e3d",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yeah, that often happens.",
    "zh": "是的，这种情况经常发生。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "happen"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "aad5b3bdbda4151cdd232828c39e9d0b469b4f62d19ea894a30208367e44e4d2",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This is what we are saying. We don’t have a problem with security lighting in any number of parking lots or stores.",
    "zh": "这正是我们要说明的。我们并不反对停车场、商店等各种场所使用安保照明。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "security lighting",
      "any number of"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "ee2f91ff4bc114ea646dc8725a7f2c52f20af27e8278eb94a15adaa1af9c1d6a",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But, and this is important, the lighting needs to be suitable and, above all, directed correctly.",
    "zh": "但是，很重要的一点是，照明需要合适，尤其要确保光线照射方向正确。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "suitable",
      "above all",
      "direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "98b51b8f4eb17f2d8a49063b4394742b2813e775d8fa0f6edf75c271b7452119",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We are becoming a society obsessed with turning night into day, but I can tell you now, not everybody finds this situation satisfactory.",
    "zh": "我们的社会越来越执着于把黑夜变成白昼；但我现在就可以告诉你，并不是每个人都觉得这种情况令人满意。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be obsessed with",
      "satisfactory"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "aaf677347dffc4cd24d3e11db891a2fcbc158dabb31319cca474e5e262bcbde5",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Is there something we can do ourselves to lessen the problem or at least not add to it?",
    "zh": "我们自己能做些什么来减轻这个问题，至少别让它加重吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "lessen",
      "add to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "ca8724ea03bbb928075d813ff94db524e8e3787e3d23981420db60e9e6f35c1a",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, there are things we can do in our own home.",
    "zh": "可以，我们在自己家里就能采取行动。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "in our own home"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "f8879408838220bcccc6abd3ca7d8e5c2c7fec15a7dac75955ba4abd74612478",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "For example, if you use lighting, be it security lighting or lighting for your barbecue in the garden, ",
    "zh": "例如，使用照明时，无论是安保灯，还是花园烧烤用灯，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be it",
      "barbecue"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "273e57fdff351c13113ed80144f490d1c59ad38249fb21da6ec9a33cca959d37",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "just make sure it is well directed, by which I mean angled downward, ",
    "zh": "都要确保照射方向合适，也就是向下照；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "angled downward"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "5665e419bcb03420734f3229edaa5372abb67fede81df0c0f36cb72688b3b2cf",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 3,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "and the light source itself, the bulb I mean, has a good cover on it.",
    "zh": "光源本身，我指的是灯泡，也要配有合适的灯罩。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "bulb"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "63af680f68d51d3fcfd565b8f08365a393c3c34318d86957bc681bcac9b2a276",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well I, for one, have learnt a lot this evening.",
    "zh": "至少我本人今晚学到了很多。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "for one"
    ]
  },
